Package: bioroster
Title: Subject and Sample Rosters for Genomics Studies
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4190-7058"))
Description: Keeps the subjects, samples, and analysis outputs of a genomics
    study in one validated object. A long-format sample manifest is read and
    validated, tumor and normal pairs are derived on demand, analysis outputs
    are registered and loaded by path template, and features can be
    translated across species through pluggable liftover and ortholog
    backends. Species and assays are values in the manifest, not columns, so
    any organism and any assay fit the same model.
